XXIII. 🌱 R7.60 CANONICAL INVARIANTS

FND-O01

The constitutional foundation SHALL be explicitly identifiable.

FND-O02

Foundation axioms SHALL be distinguishable from derived propositions.

FND-O03

Foundation dependencies SHALL be explicitly representable.

FND-O04

