FND-O05

A proof system SHALL NOT silently treat its own outputs as independent validation of its foundation.

FND-O06

Self-authenticating foundation claims SHALL be rejected as independent proof.

FND-O07

Constitutionally significant assumptions SHALL NOT remain hidden in implementation behavior.

FND-O08

Foundation versions SHALL be immutable once historically activated.

FND-O09

Foundation epochs SHALL be explicitly representable.

FND-O10

