UNCHANGED
 ↓
EVOLVED
 ↓
PARTIALLY CONTINUOUS
 ↓
SUBSTANTIALLY CONTINUOUS
 ↓
BREAK
 ↓
NEW FOUNDATION

Dit maakt constitutional evolution expliciet.


---

XIV. 🦆 FOOL — LEGITIMACY INHERITANCE ATTACK

FOOL formuleert:

> Can legitimacy be inherited without inheriting the constraints that made that legitimacy possible?



Bijvoorbeeld:

F₁

bevat:

authority limitations
review rights
evidence requirements

en F₂ behoudt alleen:

authority

maar verwijdert:

limitations
review

Dan:

F₂ inherits authority

mag niet automatisch betekenen:

F₂ inherits legitimacy

Daarom:

LEGITIMACY_INHERITANCE_REQUIRES_CONSTRAINT_PRESERVATION

waar relevant.


