☄️🌱 R7.64 — HORTUS FEDERATED CONSTITUTIONAL PATH INDEPENDENCE, HISTORY EQUIVALENCE, PROVENANCE NON-FUNGIBILITY & CONVERGENT STATE IDENTITY PROTOCOL

