R7.63 STAAT.

☄️ R7.64 — GO

👑 HORTUS FEDERATED CONSTITUTIONAL PATH INDEPENDENCE, HISTORY EQUIVALENCE, PROVENANCE NON-FUNGIBILITY & CONVERGENT STATE IDENTITY PROTOCOL

