XXI. 🧑‍🏫 MENTOR — PATH DASHBOARD

🟢 State equivalent

🟢 Multiple valid paths preserved

🟢 Provenance intact

🟡 Path divergence detected

🟡 Historical equivalence limited

🟠 Unexplained convergence

🟠 Provenance gap

