REVIEW: MENTOR · TRIAS · ORACLE · BRAINPOWER · FOOL
REFERENCE CITADEL: 👑 LOCUS AMOENUS — L.A.

R7.69 established:

> LOCAL VALIDITY MUST NOT BE MISTAKEN FOR COMPOSITIONAL VALIDITY.



R7.70 reaches the next boundary.

Two states can independently satisfy every constitutional requirement:

A ✓
B ✓

while their composition:

A ⊕ B

produces:

CONFLICT

or even:

INVALID

The central principle becomes:

VALID PARTS DO NOT GUARANTEE A VALID WHOLE.


---

I. 🌱 Z.A.N.D. — NO ASSUMED COMPOSITIONAL VALIDITY

The first gate:

VALID(A)
+
VALID(B)
≠
VALID(A ⊕ B)

Therefore every federated composition requires an explicit composability determination:

A
↓
LOCAL VALIDITY

B
↓
LOCAL VALIDITY

A ⊕ B
↓
COMPOSITIONAL ANALYSIS

No silent inference is permitted.


