VII. 🌐 COMPOSITION BOUNDARY

The federation must identify:

COMPOSITION_BOUNDARY

This defines which combinations require explicit constitutional analysis.

For example:

A + B

may be routine.

But:

A + B + C + external authority

may cross a constitutional boundary.

Thus:

COMPOSITION_SIZE
≠
COMPOSITION_RISK

A two-node composition can be more dangerous than a hundred-node composition if the interaction is authority-sensitive.


