IX. 🛑 PRIVILEGE COMPOSITION

Likewise:

P₁ ✓
P₂ ✓

does not imply:

P₁ ⊕ P₂ ✓

because two individually bounded permissions may interact to create an unbounded capability.

Therefore:

COMPOSED_PRIVILEGE_ESCALATION

must be detectable.

Example:

P₁ → read X
P₂ → transform Y

P₁ ⊕ P₂ → alter X through Y

The resulting capability must be independently evaluated.


