X

is no longer merely an implementation artifact.

It is a constitutional object with:

identity
provenance
authority
dependencies
epoch
constraints

Therefore:

A COMPOSITION MAY BECOME AN INPUT TO ANOTHER CONSTITUTIONAL COMPOSITION.


