XVII. 🔮 ORACLE — STRUCTURAL DRIFT

ORACLE observes:

T₁
 ↓
refactoring
 ↓
T₂

and detects:

STRUCTURAL_DRIFT
ASSOCIATIVITY_DRIFT
AUTHORITY_DRIFT
SEMANTIC_DRIFT
CONSEQUENCE_DRIFT

