But:

ORACLE ≠ equivalence authority

TRIAS determines whether the transformation remains constitutionally valid.


---

XVIII. 🛡️ COMPOSITIONAL CLOSURE — HIGHER ORDER

R7.70 established:

A⊕B ∈ V

R7.71 extends closure:

A,B ∈ V
A⊕B ∈ V
C ∈ V

(A⊕B)⊕C ∈ V

This is:

HIGHER_ORDER_COMPOSITIONAL_CLOSURE

But importantly:

A⊕B ∈ V
B⊕C ∈ V

does not prove:

(A⊕B)⊕C ∈ V

Closure must be tested at the actual composition level.


