R5 receives:

REPLAY_PRECOMPOSITION_PROOF(
    target_class,
    certificate_id,
    epoch
)

and reconstructs:

PROOF DOMAIN
 ↓
DOMAIN ASSUMPTIONS
 ↓
CERTIFICATE
 ↓
DEPENDENCIES
 ↓
TEMPORAL VALIDITY
 ↓
