XIV. 🏛️ CERTIFICATE CONTINUITY

R7.73 introduces:

CERTIFICATE_CONTINUITY

A certificate may survive domain evolution only where its proof assumptions and semantic scope remain valid.

Conceptually:

C₁
 ↓
ΔD
 ↓
CONTINUITY TEST
 ↓
C₁ CONTINUES

or:

