SAFE_REGION₂ = SAFE_REGION₁ ?
SAFE_REGION₂ ⊃ SAFE_REGION₁ ?

and determines which portions of the successor state space retain inherited proof coverage.

This extends the R7.72 transition:

STATE PROOF
      ↓
STATE-SPACE PROOF
      ↓
EVOLVING STATE-SPACE PROOF


