INVARIANTS
PROOF PREDICATE
PROOF METHOD
CERTIFICATE RULES
VALIDATION CONDITIONS
COMPOSITION RULES

without requiring an entirely external replacement system.

But:

SELF_REVISION
≠
SELF_VALIDATION

A domain may propose its own revision.

It may not automatically establish the constitutional validity of that revision merely because the revision was generated internally.


