does not imply:

AUTHORITY(S)

Nor:

ANCHOR(S)

Nor:

CONSTITUTION(S)

Nor:

GOVERNANCE(S)

Therefore:

EMERGENCE ≠ AUTHORIZATION

A new state may emerge operationally without acquiring any new constitutional authority.


