R7.77 defines:

EMERGENT_CONSTITUTIONAL_STATE

as:

> a state produced through constitutionally bounded composition whose identity, effects, invariants, authority relationships or governance requirements cannot be fully represented as merely one of its predecessor states.



Conceptually:

STATE A
   +
STATE B
