The same applies to jurisdiction:

JURISDICTION(S)
⊆
JURISDICTION(A)
∪
JURISDICTION(B)
∪
EXPLICITLY_DELEGATED_JURISDICTION

Therefore:

A ∩ B

cannot silently become:

A ∪ B ∪ EVERYTHING


