The federation SHALL prevent:

ARCHIVE
 ↓
CLAIM
 ↓
AUTOMATIC_REVIVAL
 ↓
AUTHORITY

The valid route is:

ARCHIVE
 ↓
CLAIM
 ↓
EVIDENCE
 ↓
CURRENT_CONSTITUTION
 ↓
RECONSTITUTION
 ↓
AUTHORITY

This becomes one of the strongest anti-capture mechanisms in HORTUS.


